// 05 - INDEPENDENT CROSS-CHECK CASE
// TWO LOOPS, TWO SUPPLIES (STATIC + FALLING CURVE), THREE PRESSURE-DEPENDENT
// SPRINKLERS AND ONE FIXED-FLOW OUTLET.  SOLVED INDEPENDENTLY BY A NODAL
// NEWTON METHOD IN TOOLS/CROSSCHECK.PY TO VERIFY THE HARDY CROSS RESULT.

UNITS     LENGTH M
UNITS     ELEVATION M
UNITS     SIZE MM
UNITS     PRESSURE KPA
UNITS     FLOW LPM
UNITS     KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD    HW
OPTION    TOL_FLOW 0.0005
OPTION    TOL_LOOP 0.0002
OPTION    MAXITER 20000

WATER     A 0.0 950
NODE      B 2.0
SPRINKLER C 2.0 -50 80
WATER     D 4.0 900 2000 780 5000 400
SPRINKLER E 4.0 -50 115
SPRINKLER F 6.0 -50 80

USE       BORE 120
PIPE      P1 A B 25.0 150.0
PIPE      P2 B C 30.0 100.0
PIPE      P3 C D 22.0 100.0
PIPE      P4 D B 35.0 80.0
PIPE      P5 C E 18.0 80.0
PIPE      P6 E D 20.0 65.0
PIPE      P7 E F 15.0 50.0

FIXEDFLOW F1 B 400 200
